> explain select * from a285co, (values ((select i from (values (3), (2), ((select 7))) v(i) order by i limit 1))) w(i) where a285co.i = w.i
QUERY PLAN:text
Seq Scan on a285co  (cost=0.13..36.13 rows=1 width=16)
  Filter: (i = (InitPlan 4).col1)
  InitPlan 2
    ->  Limit  (cost=0.06..0.07 rows=1 width=4)
          InitPlan 1
            ->  Result  (cost=0.00..0.01 rows=1 width=4)
          ->  Sort  (cost=0.05..0.06 rows=3 width=4)
                Sort Key: "*VALUES*".column1
                ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*"  (cost=0.00..0.04 rows=3 width=4)
  InitPlan 4
    ->  Limit  (cost=0.06..0.07 rows=1 width=4)
          InitPlan 3
            ->  Result  (cost=0.00..0.01 rows=1 width=4)
          ->  Sort  (cost=0.05..0.06 rows=3 width=4)
                Sort Key: "*VALUES*_1".column1
                ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*_1"  (cost=0.00..0.04 rows=3 width=4)
-- EXPLAIN

